--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The fixtures under contracts/fixtures/ are synthetic. Where a fixture names a
case identifier derived from the Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard (BFCL)
v3 Base dataset, it carries synthetic values rather than upstream ground truth.
Nothing in this repository is official BFCL data, an accuracy measurement, a
ranking, or a certification.
